# Play test of Ribcage Reef (CIPlay ribcage_reef, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe ("offset").
# The village's shore at 2 m along x -2..48 (z about -5..9), the gate at -3 2, the houses on stilts, the highest rib's
# ladders at 23.8 -1.45 (its platform 12 m up); the tide pool at 38 10 (3 m under the sea); the stage round 43 1, the four
# rib-chime posts at 31/36 x -3.8/7.8, the jaw at x 49 and the throat's gate at x 51.5, the throat sloping down to 59.6 22;
# the skull's chamber x 59..65, z 25..34 (floor 9 m down, door south at x 59..62); the altar on the east horn at 92 22.
island Ribcage Reef
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Bone-Singers' Festival
wait 5
expect animals Chicken 3
expect animals Turtle 3
at -8 2 h=3
walk -8 2 to 4 2 h=2
zone ribvillage
expect step 1
read The festival invitation
expect step 2
open Tail box
expect step 3
kill Roach
expect step 4
open First song shell
expect step 5
open Second song shell
expect story songshell 2
expect step 6
at 22.6 -1.4 h=15
zone ribtop
expect step 7
open Third song shell
expect step 8
open Fourth song shell
expect story songshell 4
expect step 9
at 44 -3 h=3
zone jawstage
expect step 10
read The song's rule
expect step 11
use ribwind
expect message dead clack
use ribtide
use ribwind
use ribstar
use ribdeep
expect story mask 1
expect step 12
wait 4
at 54 6 h=1.5
zone throatzone
expect step 13
at 60.5 20 h=-5
at 62 27 h=-7.5
zone skull
expect step 14
read The eldest singer's tablet
expect step 15
open The eye's pearl
expect story pearl 1
expect step 16
kill Angler fish
expect step 17
expect shown braincase
open The skull's brain-case
expect story heartbone 1
expect step 18
at 92 16 h=5
zone altarzone
expect step 19
use altar
expect shown festival
expect step 20
read The singers' blessing
expect step 21
open The festival chest
expect done
open Cook pot box
open Sunk canoe
